  <mxCell id="102" value="Legend: Sec. 22-B — SR mandatory refusal (forged / prohibited / attached property / notified). Sec. 22-C — DR cancellation suo motu or on complaint (show-cause → books &amp; indexes). Sec. 22-D — appeal to IGR ≤ 30 days (confirm / modify / cancel DR order). Limitation Act + condonation applies to 22-C / 22-D. Civil Court = optional further judicial challenge (not Sec. 77). Title disputes excluded from forged-document enquiry. Secs. 81-A / 81-B = penalties (compliance)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#f5f5f5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
